  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The attack is over, but it's left something left behind. An arrowhead, a chip from the creature's tooth, or the broken point of a sword, perhaps. Whatever it is, you can still feel it cutting within you. Any time you use an action, bonus action, and movement on the same turn you are &Reference[incapacitated]{incapacitated} until the end of your next turn.</p><p><em>Treatment</em> - A DC 19 General Surgery removes the foreign body and ends this effect.</p>",
